# Verify commands

Do **not** run `npm run lint`, `npm run build`, or
`npm run lint && npm run build` unless the user explicitly requests it.

Do not run these commands proactively after code changes, even when editing
TypeScript or React files.

If verification is useful, mention that the user can run lint or build locally
instead of running the commands yourself.
